## Secrets — hard rules

- **Never** commit the PEM/private key, `.env`, or server passwords into the repo.
- **Never** paste the private key into HTML/CSS/JS or chat replies.
- Key lives only at `%USERPROFILE%\.ssh\agro-zonic-fit.pem` (outside the project).

## After any project-changing work

Ask **both** (same turn as git ask, unless user already ordered one or both):

1. «Commit va git push qilaymi?»
2. «Serverga deploy qilaymi? (`agro.zonic.fit`)»

Only deploy when the user says yes (or already ordered deploy in the same message).

## Deploy procedure (when approved)

1. Ensure latest approved changes are on `origin/main` (commit+push first if user approved).
2. On the server, update the static clone and reload nginx only if needed:

```bash
ssh -i "%USERPROFILE%\.ssh\agro-zonic-fit.pem" -o IdentitiesOnly=yes ubuntu@3.65.92.39 "cd /var/www/agro.zonic.fit && git fetch origin && git reset --hard origin/main"
```

3. If nginx/site config changed: `sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx`.
4. Smoke-check: `https://agro.zonic.fit`

